@startuml
[*] --> Created : User creates account
Created --> Watching : User starts watching a video after creating an account
Watching --> Uploading : User starts uploading a video while watching another video
Uploading --> Watching : Upload completed, user returns to watching
Watching --> Likes List View : User saves a video to their likes list while watching it
Likes List View --> Watching : User watches a saved video from the likes list
Created --> Discussion : User enters discussion option after creating account
Discussion --> [*] : User exits discussion option

state Created {
  entry: User creates account
}

state Watching {
  entry: User starts watching a video
}

state Uploading {
  entry: User starts uploading a video
}

state Likes List View {
  entry: User views saved videos from likes list
}

state Discussion {
  entry: User enters discussion option
}
@enduml
